This file marks the shared part of content-packs/ as slots only. It stays in both copies of the
repository, the public one and the work copy. While it is here, tests/test_packs.py checks that
every lesson in the shared packs (content-packs/iac-applied/) is still a slot and that no shared
pack holds screenshots or other files.

Real lessons never go in the shared packs. In the work copy they live in content-packs/internal/,
a copy of iac-applied/ with the same lesson ids, which the public repository never creates and
an upstream merge never touches. Do not delete this file there.
